BT 1 0 0 1 0 122.9 Tm 13.2 TL /F1 9.1 Tf .188235 .219608 .2 rg (\177 Splash screen, light theme and bottom navigation for Home and Payments.) Tj  T* (\177 Home monthly summary and recent decided activity.) Tj  T* (\177 Payments list ordered newest first with party, AED amount and status.) Tj  T* (\177 Payment Details for approved and rejected payments only.) Tj  T* (\177 Global draggable Debug FAB that creates an incoming pending request.) Tj  T* (\177 Approval overlay shown over the current screen with masked party and amount.) Tj  T* (\177 Approve and Reject actions protected by demo OTP 8888.) Tj  T* (\177 Consistent state update across Home, Payments and Payment Details.) Tj  T* (\177 Swipe-to-delete for decided payments with refreshed state.) Tj  T* (\177 Loading, empty, error, offline indicator and retry-oriented UI states.) Tj T* ET
